      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was meant to have option if we would like not to preserve logs, to just invoke restperfclient, when those logs could be large in size. But it might not be necessary and we could always preserve the logs. `results` folder files are meant to be exposed after finished test run in jenkins, GHA, etc. to be accessible and stored from previous runs.",
